/P 116 0 R
/E (The World Health Organization \(WHO\) created the Global Code of Practice in 2010 to encourage ethical recruitment of health workers. Some countries have also supported African nations with medical training and aid. However, these actions have not been strong enough. Many health workers still leave because their home countries lack proper hospitals, pay, and safety. The United Nations Development Programme \(UNDP\) and African Union have both highlighted the brain drain as a threat to development and health equality.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
